    - 30
    - 30
  - name: Body Slam
    vrDescription: 'A: hold to see the charge and the first enemy it meets, release to charge where you walk (or where your right hand points). Enemies around the first one hit are knocked up and stunned for 1 second; a hit takes 40% off the cooldown.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 0f02d325699c407095147464426249e0, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 14
    - 13.5
