    - 50
  - name: Explosive Cask
    vrDescription: 'Left trigger: hold and point your left hand where the cask should land (the ring shows the blast), release to hurl it. It bursts, knocking enemies away from its centre.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b08778687dbf4ff3890cf2f59c444a2b, type: 3}
